AED Final Project - Group 22

NUCLEUS
NUCLEUS application's goal is to provide a single platform for people and service providers to connect. Forming a bridge between customers and service providers such that customers do not need to open many windows to complete tasks; instead, a single application is sufficient to meet the eight most important requirements. The application can be maintained by the organization's administrator, while the customer can operate on any domain, based on their needs.

Simplicity: Eliminate unnecessary design elements and have a single application easy to understand.
Navigability: Simple to navigate and straight forward so visitors can naturally access all elements.
Accessibility: Application will be compatible with all devices (mobile, tablet, etc.). Easy to access for all age groups.
Conventionality: Multiple services present in a with variety of operation within the same application .
User-friendly: Gathering responses for service provided from users to get the best results and improving the store functionalities.

